Monorepo & Workspace Specification

Project: Ohira

Document ID: OHIRA-0004

Version: 1.0

Status: Founder's Draft


---

Purpose

This document defines the repository structure, workspace organization, package responsibilities, dependency rules, coding conventions, and development workflow for Ohira.

The goals are:

Keep the codebase modular.

Enable independent package development.

Support community contributions.

Simplify testing and releases.

Allow Ohira to evolve from a CLI into a complete platform.



